I can't make that edit: the reviewer role is read-only (`edit: deny`), and the tags on the note are **already** `[Forgejo, Backup_Verification]` — TitleCase with an underscore is the *problem*, not the fix. Root `AGENTS.md` requires tags to be lowercase kebab-case (`^[a-z0-9]+(-[a-z0-9]+)*$`), so the correct form is `[forgejo, backup-verification]`; that correction is recorded as a `structure` finding for the editor, who is the only role permitted to revise the file with a cited rule.

